ity where Randy makes a batch of  cupcakes the dessert spells out the word  be my pal in the English version of the  film but in international versions picks  our animators went with smiley faces  instead it would have been way too hard  for them to translate the words in every  language especially since the number of  letters is different in various dialects  so they went with the universal smiley  face instead and it worked out great  plains the character Rachelle looks  completely different depending on where  you watch planes she has a different  color and sometimes even a different  name in the US the racer is pink red and  white and in Australia she's red green  yellow black and white with a kangaroo  on her side in China her name is Yun  yang Fei and she's red yellow and white  and in Germany her name is Heidi and  she's white black yellow and red  Zootopia  American culture is pretty well  understood in most areas of the world  but  animators still made subtle changes to  Zootopia to bridge the cultural gap in  other parts of the world the movie is  actually entitled to tropi with the  movies fictional news channels vnn shows  two newscasters a snow leopard and a  moose in the US Canada and France but in  Japan the moose is replaced by a raccoon  dog in Australia and New Zealand viewers  see a koala bear instead China sees a  panda bear  Brazil sees a Jaguar and the UK audience  sees a Welsh Corgi were you surprised to  see how different cartoons look in other  countries let us know in the comment  section down below and if you enjoyed  this video please give it a big thumbs  up  [Music]

